---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CERES TECHNOLOGY | INDUSTRIAL DATA SYSTEMS">
  <main class="pt-14">

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center px-8 bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden border-b-2 border-surface-container">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#45474b 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px;"></div>
      <div class="max-w-5xl relative z-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container border-l-2 border-primary mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">SYSTEM STATUS: ACTIVE_DATA_STREAM</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-8 uppercase">
          Turn scattered data<br/>
          <span class="text-primary">into decisions</span><br/>
          you can act on
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mb-10 leading-[1.7]">
          Deploying high-precision analytics engines for enterprise supply chain visibility. Eliminate uncertainty with industrial-grade data synthesis and predictive modeling.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/"} class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 transition-all">Initialize Protocol</a>
           <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/"} class="bg-surface-container text-on-surface border border-outline-variant px-8 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase hover:bg-surface-bright transition-all">Request Audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-1/3 h-full opacity-20 hidden lg:block border-l border-outline-variant/20 p-8">
        <div class="h-full w-full machined-gradient border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col p-4 font-mono text-[10px] gap-2 overflow-hidden text-primary">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span>RAW_DATA_INPUT</span><span>88.42%</span></div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-container h-1"><div class="bg-primary h-full w-4/5"></div></div>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 opacity-50">
            <div>&gt; TRACE_LOG: 0x82...FA2</div>
            <div>&gt; SYNCING_NODE_04... DONE</div>
            <div>&gt; ANALYZING_VECTORS...</div>
            <div>&gt; THREAT_DETECTED: FALSE</div>
            <div>&gt; LATENCY: 12ms</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TRUST BAR -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container px-8 py-6 border-b-2 border-surface-container-lowest">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-normal text-outline uppercase">VALIDATED BY:</span>
        <div class="h-6 w-32 bg-outline-variant/30" title="Global Logistics Corp"></div>
        <div class="h-6 w-28 bg-outline-variant/30" title="AeroSystems Int"></div>
        <div class="h-6 w-40 bg-outline-variant/30" title="Federal Resource Management"></div>
        <div class="h-6 w-24 bg-outline-variant/30" title="Titan Manufacturing"></div>
        <div class="h-6 w-36 bg-outline-variant/30" title="Ceres Industrial Partners"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROBLEM SECTION -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0 bg-surface">
      <div class="p-12 lg:p-24 border-r-2 border-surface-container flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface uppercase mb-8">The Blindness of Density</h2>
        <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant mb-12 text-lg leading-[1.7]">In modern enterprise operations, the problem isn't a lack of data—it's the catastrophic surplus of disconnected signals.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-6">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error mt-1">warning</span>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Data Silos</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Critical information trapped in proprietary legacy frameworks.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error mt-1">warning</span>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Reactive Response</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Managing crises after they manifest, rather than predicting vectors.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error mt-1">warning</span>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Operational Static</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">High-noise environments masking low-frequency, high-impact risks.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest relative overflow-hidden">
        <img class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40 mix-blend-luminosity" alt="Technical macro shot of glowing computer circuitry" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB0MZIrIwbGHH-XFTdihAo_s1Auk1r8LUJ7_Ez2hFFQAw2GXgR6jbEa0k81aAHuaPt7LoYlbBsW6-cx636xrUAPNzxwECbGbeV-6zAXhlAr5fU3V36BPbHpK0tzx8cqxj3tqakmet-iybf1o2fR9KkWJ4df8i0eYUB5T7d3r_NO4eMeLasXudQDKIgZxx6frhdIQIjVHAkrk_XZBypZ2Mockgj8pE0BdtATpZlQrQ_YzPA4gtqpbmojDTmESV7lMFKOl8VMzImxAEc"/>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface to-transparent"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SOLUTION SECTION (5 BENEFIT CARDS) -->
    <section class="p-8 lg:p-16 bg-surface-container-low">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4">The Synthesis Engine</h2>
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-primary mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-b-4 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all group">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-4 text-3xl">hub</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-3 text-on-surface">Unified Fabric</h3>
          <p class="text-[13px] font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Cross-platform integration layer that consolidates heterogeneous data streams into a single source of truth.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-b-4 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all group">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-4 text-3xl">analytics</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-3 text-on-surface">Predictive Logic</h3>
          <p class="text-[13px] font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Advanced heuristic modeling to forecast supply chain disruptions 48-72 hours before onset.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-b-4 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all group">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-4 text-3xl">security</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-3 text-on-surface">Hardened Security</h3>
          <p class="text-[13px] font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Sovereign data encryption and military-grade access protocols for enterprise-scale compliance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-b-4 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all group">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-4 text-3xl">speed</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-3 text-on-surface">Zero Latency</h3>
          <p class="text-[13px] font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Real-time processing of high-frequency transactional data without performance degradation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-b-4 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all group">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-4 text-3xl">settings_input_component</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-3 text-on-surface">Modular Core</h3>
          <p class="text-[13px] font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Highly adaptable architecture that scales vertically with organizational complexity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW IT WORKS (4-STEP) -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 lg:p-24">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none">Operational<br/>Deployment</h2>
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-outline mb-1 uppercase">MODULE_ALPHA_01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-0 border border-outline-variant/30">
          <div class="p-8 border-r border-outline-variant/30 hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
            <span class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-outline-variant mb-6 block data-mono">01</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Ingestion</h4>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Automated ingestion of raw unstructured data through secure REST/GraphQL gateways.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 border-r border-outline-variant/30 hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
            <span class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-outline-variant mb-6 block data-mono">02</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Normalization</h4>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Ceres OS harmonizes data formats into a standardized industrial ontological framework.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 border-r border-outline-variant/30 hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
            <span class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-outline-variant mb-6 block data-mono">03</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Synthesis</h4>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Our proprietary AI core identifies correlation vectors and anomalous patterns.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
            <span class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-outline-variant mb-6 block data-mono">04</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-4">Execution</h4>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Direct output of actionable intelligence via the Unified Console or external API endpoints.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHY CERES (4 VALUE PROPS) -->
    <section class="bg-surface grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="p-12 lg:p-24 machined-gradient border-r-2 border-surface-container">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] mb-12">The Competitive Advantage</h2>
        <div class="space-y-12">
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary data-mono">01</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-2">Industrial Lineage</h5>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Built from the ground up for high-stakes environments where 99.99% uptime is the baseline requirement.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary data-mono">02</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-2">Sovereign Control</h5>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Your data remains your asset. We provide the intelligence layer without compromising data ownership.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary data-mono">03</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-2">Speed to Intelligence</h5>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Reduce decision latency from days to milliseconds. Act at the speed of the market.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary data-mono">04</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base mb-2">Cost Optimization</h5>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Eliminate operational waste through precision forecasting and resource allocation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-12 lg:p-24 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
        <div class="relative w-64 h-64 mb-8">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 border-4 border-outline-variant/30 rotate-45"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-4 border-2 border-primary/40 rotate-[15deg]"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-mono font-light text-6xl text-primary data-mono">94%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h6 class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-2">Accuracy Metric</h6>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Validated prediction success rate</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROOF/OUTCOME SECTION -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 lg:p-16 border-y-2 border-surface-container">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-surface-container p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-outline-variant uppercase">CASE_REF: 882-X</div>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-5xl mb-6">format_quote</span>
        <p class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none mb-8">"Ceres transformed our logistics operation from a reactive cost center into a strategic weapon. We now see bottlenecks before they occur, saving an estimated $4.2M in quarterly transit delays."</p>
        <div>
          <span class="block font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] text-sm">Director of Operations</span>
          <span class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Fortune 500 Global Logistics Firm</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- USE CASE SECTION (BENTO GRID) -->
    <section class="p-8 lg:p-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] mb-12 border-l-4 border-primary pl-4">Sector Application</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 h-[600px]">
        <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface-container p-8 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end group cursor-pointer">
          <img class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity" alt="Shipping container terminal at night" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAb3KirbeKk7odgWiNAjTXeSp3thdMGaCfd5YyFpHOlTbSlvONHLkKn5CwgKPepBKldk7kklNfdnzbnCBaeC48QfovYwmUXEOyTCmeMX2bzptjTd3W1Vz3R2XpR0lXbDdUzTmzbJpbCjivbwRx73crvonbCxyh2ottWxjva_rB43ay8USxKT75zMza5JKJuFSNAGMBY0jg52JvJy7EgvJWJd4AyEtXs44TCEZ0TrUMc-LmiHFb4koRYMnILUfjoYH91N26XZ8lvnMs"/>
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Global Logistics</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant max-w-md leading-[1.7]">End-to-end visibility for intermodal transport and terminal operations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end group cursor-pointer">
          <img class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity" alt="Robotic arm in manufacturing facility" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBhoGsrVWWnZM1Iu3W027y3RSEu6jwDNL4jMz18YrviHTCMjNQlq-Hkf-MyyludDOErqUYJJc5WQhClY2PZeKXn2xXhftdB3Nk81v39cjWH3Vd-paVog3oCTLl4M-6dtRuBNyl2ANL_ZQd7JKmwNPJZwEMnTi-Jiej2CSGQjR-NSMbqM3kUOFJMkDBbMOgizW4sZMvXTwrhhVAZi1sixOuYqKSRESkjGv8iXjPTXMxugvbNJl_KOqcE5CLE4VAvFwVpx1IRZ5ZXlH0"/>
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Advanced Mfg</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">JIT supply chain optimization and predictive maintenance integration.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end group cursor-pointer">
          <img class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity" alt="Energy grid control room" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCpg6VrKqlqc9lZQlSJwiSYsxbnskT13Pxdoc6oBw4LWO7qR2cKvt4Ikr4ZDbCr3baTVzeGBmv1_NU2cPJwJvz8Az2Jehn6A5PpHaSz6Fy3K8QKF2RfoMjQEUH6fPgxaUBlrWAHayNVDmizN3AdPP7c6-jDEsU0FmHN2UuwWgko_gO-D1WsMIUUF8GklITa_tSEWjzclBUTFVM5FF_Kfg4d40DHwzo-OxvuW-2MFTGu_v5Sp_ewuRobgltG7DymHjaGr78Fpt5C8nI"/>
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Energy Infrastructure</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Grid stability monitoring and resource distribution analytics.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface-container p-8 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end group cursor-pointer">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 machined-gradient opacity-50"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Federal &amp; Defense</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Secure information environments for strategic asset management and threat modeling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- IMPLEMENTATION SECTION -->
    <section class="bg-surface p-12 lg:p-24 border-t-2 border-surface-container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6">Phased Integration</h2>
        <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant mb-12 leading-[1.7]">Deployment is executed in three distinct stages to ensure zero operational downtime and immediate value realization.</p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-surface-container border-l-2 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base">Phase 01: Environment Audit</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] opacity-50 uppercase">2-4 WEEKS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-surface-container border-l-2 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base">Phase 02: Core Synthesis</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] opacity-50 uppercase">4-8 WEEKS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-surface-container border-l-2 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-base">Phase 03: Full Scale Deployment</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] opacity-50 uppercase">ONGOING</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ SECTION -->
    <section class="p-8 lg:p-24 bg-surface-container-lowest">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] mb-12">Technical Inquiries</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h6 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-3 text-primary">How does Ceres handle legacy ERP data?</h6>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Our integration layer uses universal connectors and proprietary normalization protocols to extract and synthesize data from any legacy system without modification of the source.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h6 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-3 text-primary">What is the security standard?</h6>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">All data is encrypted at rest and in transit using AES-256 and TLS 1.3. We offer on-premise, air-gapped, and sovereign cloud deployment options for highly sensitive operations.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h6 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-3 text-primary">Is the AI model explainable?</h6>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Yes. Our "White Box" philosophy ensures every decision output is accompanied by a transparent logic trail, allowing analysts to audit the reasoning behind any predictive signal.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h6 class="font-headline font-bold text-base uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-3 text-primary">Can we customize the dashboard?</h6>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">The Unified Console is fully modular. Users can build custom views, alert triggers, and reporting templates based on specific operational KPIs and command structures.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
